{% layout 'base' %}
{% block content %}
	<h1 dir="ltr"><span style="">Privacy Policy</span></h1>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<b><strong style="">Last Updated: 29 Oct 2026</strong></b>
	</p>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>This policy (the "Agreement") outlines the usage and processing standards for all data acquired by RoSim (the "Service") or its developers during your interactions with the service.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Scope of Policy</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>The terms of this Agreement shall apply to any users interacting with the Service or its automated network assistive applications,
			including "bot applications" (the "Bot") interacting with the Discord service as provided by Discord, Inc.</span
		>
	</p>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>By using any applications, products, or services provided or published by the developers, or any derivative products or services used
			by the Service to deliver the services, you are hereby accepting all terms of this Agreement and agree to be bound by its handling of
			your information, including potentially identifiable information.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Data We Collect</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style="">RoSim collects the following information when users interacts with its services:</span>
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li value="1" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Account identifiers </strong></b
			><span style="">(user identification numbers, codes, and sequences)</span>
		</li>
		<li value="2" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">In-game data generated by you </strong></b
			><span style=""
				>(any information generated while interacting with RoSim resulting in data being saved, such as lap times, leaderboard ranks, or
				access information)</span
			>
		</li>
		<li value="3" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Timestamps &amp; metadata </strong></b
			><span style="">(additional data attached to most data-types we collect)</span>
		</li>
	</ul>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">How &amp; Why We Collect Information</span></h2>
    <table dir="ltr">
        <tbody>
            <tr dir="ltr">
                <th
                    style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;"
                    dir="ltr"
                >
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Data Type Collected</span></p>
                </th>
                <th
                    style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;"
                    dir="ltr"
                >
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">When it's Collected</span></p>
                </th>
                <th
                    style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;"
                    dir="ltr"
                >
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Collection Purpose</span></p>
                </th>
            </tr>
            <tr dir="ltr">
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">User IDs</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Any interaction with the service</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr">
                        <span style=""
                            >Saving stored data to profiles, identifying users for moderation and in-game actions, and bot functionality</span
                        >
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr dir="ltr">
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">RoSim generated user-content</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Upon interaction with in-game experiences</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 272px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr">
                        <span style=""
                            >Save player content and progress, aggregate data for leaderboards and retention analytics</span
                        >
                    </p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height: 61px;" dir="ltr">
                <td style="width: 75px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Metadata</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 75px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Whenever data is collected</span></p>
                </td>
                <td style="width: 75px;vertical-align: top; text-align: start;" dir="ltr">
                    <p dir="ltr"><span style="">Analytics, verification, and moderation </span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Data Storage &amp; Retention</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr"><span style="">We collect only the data needed to provide the Service.</span></p>
	<p dir="ltr"><span style="">Data is stored primarily using:</span></p>
	<ul>
		<li value="1" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Roblox </strong></b
			><span style=""
				>Data Storage containers for in-game data that is not required for bot functionality or cross-platform analytics, verification, user
				actions, or moderation.</span
			>
		</li>
		<li value="2" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Cloudflare</strong></b
			><span style=""> D1 containers for data required for Bot functionality and user verification.</span>
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>Data is stored until the user stops interacting with the Service and may be held for a period of time not to exceed 2 years. Inactive
			data will continue to be aggregated for use in analytics and moderation.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">User Rights</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr"><span style="">You have the right to access and control your data:</span></p>
	<ul>
		<li value="1" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Data Access:</strong></b
			><span style="">
				You may request a copy of the personal data we hold about you, including data stored in Cloudflare D1, Roblox DataStores, and data
				used by the Bot. Requests are submitted by email; we may ask you to verify your identity (e.g., via your linked account) before
				releasing data.</span
			>
		</li>
		<li value="2" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Correction:</strong></b
			><span style="">
				All data is derived from RoSim in-game systems or services (i.e. Roblox for User ID provisioning) and is not considered correctable
				data. Most stored data is system-generated and tied to account IDs, so it can't be edited directly. If you believe data about you is
				inaccurate, contact us and we'll review and correct or delete it as appropriate.</span
			>
		</li>
		<li value="3" dir="ltr">
			<b><strong style="">Deletion:</strong></b
			><span style="">
				Deletion for all user data (including Roblox Data Storage data and Cloudflare D1 data) may be requested at any time.</span
			>
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>Developers will attempt to release this data and take action on requests within 30 days of request. Please submit all data requests
			to the developer via email.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Security &amp; Processing</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Only authorized developers have access to user data and follow internal protection
			standards when accessing and editing user data. We do not sell your data or share with any third parties outside entities required for
			the operation of RoSim, each governed by separate Privacy Policies.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Children's Privacy</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>RoSim's Discord Bot is only available to users who meet Discord's minimum age requirement in their local jurisdiction (13+, or higher
			where local law requires). The Roblox experience may be used by, and is directed towards, players of any age, but external data
			storage and Bot functionality requires user verification of being over the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect, share, or make
			available data from underage users and promptly delete all user data from underage users found violating this policy.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Policy Amendments</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style=""
			>We reserve the right to make changes to and update this policy periodically. Any changes to this policy will be announced prior to
			their effective date via the Service's official Discord announcement stream.</span
		>
	</p>
	<h2 dir="ltr"><span style="">Contact</span></h2>
	<p dir="ltr">
		<span style="">Email: </span
		><a href="https://mailto:ched@cheds.app/" rel="noreferrer" dir="ltr"><span style="">ched@cheds.app</span></a>
	</p>
{% endblock %}
